  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sea Glass Pointe is located in the Grande Pointe community just .5 miles from the beach and near Rosemary, Aly's and all that 30-A has to offer! It boasts several amenities featuring a large community pool located along beautiful Lake Powell with private access to the community dock and clubhouse. Whether you're driving, carting, biking, or walking, you're just minutes away from shopping and the most fabulous dining experiences! You're also just one mile from historic Camp Helen State Park!<br>The space<br>Sea Glass Pointe has a stunning open floor plan and has lots of natural light and exudes charm and character that includes: 10ft ceilings on main level, beautiful hardwood flooring, stainless steel appliances including a gas range, and a large open dining area. All bedrooms have access to a full bathroom! In addition, there is a half bath on the main living floor. There is a large kitchen great for entertaining! Additional features include an outdoor shower and a second floor large, covered balcony with TV and a second large, uncovered balcony on the third floor that is great for relaxing and tanning.<br>Guest access<br>The entire home is yours to enjoy and make memories in!<br>Other things to note<br>We have 4 adult beach cruiser bikes, 2 kids bikes, 2 scooters, beach chairs, beach toys, cooler, beach towels, boogie boards, skim boards and fishing poles for our guests. They can be found in the garage.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
